WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.630
I am not lying!

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.100
I even have a witness.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:07.760
Who?

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.540
It was...

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.260
...someone I do not know.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:15.770
I believe you.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:18.770
You speak with such certainty.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.240
Then, it really must not have been there earlier.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:27.490
Besides, this card was buried deeper
than where I had buried it.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.990
I had been mystified for the longest time.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.930
Why had Sachiko-san chosen
her to be her little sister?

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:47.070
An ordinary student, with no
particularly distinguishing traits.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:51.740
She is not worthy of Sachiko-san.

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:01.490
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:06.290
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:11.260
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:14.130
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:17.530
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:20.800
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:26.340
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:40.120
Maria Watches Over Us

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:02.930
The Red Card

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.640
This morning, when I woke up,

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:08.920
the first thought that came to my mind...

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:13.790
...was the realization that
today was Valentine's Day.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:18.390
I, Uzawa Mifuyu,

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.320
enrolled at Lillian Girls' Academy
starting in high school.

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:25.530
But I am a little different from
other outside applicants.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:31.830
There was a time when I used to
attend Lillian's kindergarten.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.170
Even then, Sachiko-san...

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.310
...was already a special person to me.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.080
I shall see you later.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:52.150
Good morning, Mifuyu-chan.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.190
Good morning, Tomoko-chan.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.590
Good morning, Sachiko-chan.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:57.930
Good morning.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:04.160
Sachiko-san had a certain quality that
set her apart from the other girls.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:07.340
Something she was born to, you could say.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:09.400
A quality that gave her an aloofness.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:18.920
Have her do a drawing...

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:20.980
Have her perform a dance...

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.850
Sachiko-san was never outdone by anyone.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.960
Well done, Sachiko-chan.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.000
Yet, one could not say, even to be kind,

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.490
that she fit in at the kindergarten.

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:37.800
Children are sensitive...

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:41.170
...to those with an aura about
them that differs from their own.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:48.040
Sachiko-san did not bat an eye as her
classmates looked on with curiosity...

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.840
...and she ignored them with a
look of displeasure on her face.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:55.350
Sachiko-san was silently fighting.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:59.790
Because of a casual comment from a classmate,

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:02.320
she even switched to taking the bus to school.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:06.400
Going so far as to taking
the troublesome method...

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:09.560
...of being driven to the bus
station closest to her home...

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:11.810
...and then taking the bus from there.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.240
My ordinary eyes...

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:19.610
...could not help but follow such
trivialities of Sachiko-san's daily life.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.180
However,

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.550
that joy did not last for long.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.790
My father was transferred...

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:33.320
...and I ended up having to leave Lillian.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.690
Soon, I would no longer
be able to watch Sachiko-san.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.730
At that time,

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.870
it was not that I was sad to
say good-bye to Sachiko-san...

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.500
...or anything of the sort.

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:48.570
I was merely sorely disappointed...

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.000
...that I would not be able
to watch Sachiko-san anymore.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:10.260
Mifuyu-chan!

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:10.970
Are you okay?!

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:11.950
Mifuyu-chan!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.310
You're bleeding!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.070
This is terrible!

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.640
We have to go get the teacher!

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:20.640
I'll go, too!

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:21.540
Me, too!

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:26.650
Are you all right?

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:31.050
What are you doing?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.050
Does it hurt?

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:39.050
You got what you deserved for not
obeying the teacher's instructions.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.400
I realized the reason for
the offended expression...

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:48.340
...on Sachiko-san's face that
I saw before I fell off the swing.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.560
It was because standing on the
swings was against the rules.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.540
Oh, the handkerchief!

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:55.030
You can have it.

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:57.040
I have another one on me.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:03.080
That was the first time I had
ever spoken with Sachiko-san,

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:05.110
or received anything from her.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:09.150
Soon, the day came when I was
to leave the kindergarten.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:15.620
Here.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:18.060
I told you that you could have it.

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:20.840
But my mother said I should return it.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:22.100
And this, too.

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:22.940
What is it?

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:24.200
She said it's chocolate.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:25.270
Chocolate?

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:28.340
To thank you. That's what my mother said.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.310
I see.

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.640
Give your mother my regards, Mifuyu-chan.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:37.650
That was the first time I had ever
heard my name spoken by Sachiko-san.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.080
See you again.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:40.690
See you again!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.730
It was not goodbye.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.590
Someday, I would return to this place again.

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:56.660
To be near her again, someday, without fail.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.710
See you again, Sachiko-chan.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:06.600
Ten years later, I returned to Lillian.

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:11.680
Mayumi lizuka
Mifuyu Uzawa
Sachiko Ogasawara
Yayoi Serizawa

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.390
Grown up,

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.360
Sachiko-san surely must now be
a serene and elegant woman,

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:18.950
just like Maria-sama.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:22.030
I couldn't wait to be reunited with her.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:26.130
Sachiko-san.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:27.990
It's been a long time.

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:30.630
Have we met before?

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.400
Sachiko-san, the teacher is asking for you.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:36.940
Would you please excuse me?

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:38.430
C-Certainly...

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:47.320
It was then that I realized that
people do not change so easily.

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:52.650
The aura about her was as stern as ever,
keeping people at bay.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.060
And I had no distinguishing traits,

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:58.730
so ordinary that I left no impression on people...

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:04.440
The distance between her and me...

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:06.930
...had not changed one bit since 10 years ago.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:11.540
Just one of many classmates.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:18.080
In time, she became Rosa Chinensis
en bouton's little sister...

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.850
...and she became an even more distant figure.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.250
Even so,

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:26.460
just by being able to return to a
life where I could watch Sachiko-san...

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.690
...I was happy.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.730
Would I be able to give these to her this year?

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.100
Probably not.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.830
Because on Valentine's Day last year, she...

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.910
...did not accept chocolates from anyone.

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:50.710
I am very sorry, but I cannot accept those.

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:53.120
Because I have no reason to take them.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:57.490
Would she accept these if she
had a reason to take them?

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:59.620
Just like that time.

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:21.540
Sachiko-san...

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:31.680
Sachi...

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.900
Where is she going?

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.240
Is it for today's treasure hunt?

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:48.370
She's about to go hide the card somewhere?

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:54.550
I could not suppress my curiosity.

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:16.330
That's Sachiko-san's red card...

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.860
Maria Watches Over Us

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:25.880
I wonder where the boutons hid their cards.

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:28.570
You have to think the Rose
Mansion is a likely place.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:33.220
No one will be able to find Sachiko-san's card.

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:40.560
The red card was like the joker.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.560
It would be up to me to
decide how I would use it.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:44.630
Mifuyu-san?

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.870
You are on day duty today, aren't you?

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:48.900
Y-Yes.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.270
Ohmori-sensei said to go to the
science preparation room...

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.770
...to get the materials that will
be used during the 5th period.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.140
Oh, all right.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:58.010
Mifuyu-san.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:01.180
Shall I help you as well?

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:03.610
No, that won't be necessary.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:05.590
I can manage the materials on my own.

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:07.750
I see. Then I shall leave it to you.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:13.490
The moment I saw Sachiko-san's face,
I became afraid.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:17.200
I found the card by jumping the gun
and I did not have the nerve...

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:21.070
...to take that card to the
Rose Mansion feigning innocence.

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:24.390
If I returned it now, I could still make it in time.

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:27.340
But it was such a stroke of
luck that I had this card...

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:32.210
There will be one each of these red,
yellow, and white cards...

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.410
...hidden somewhere on the school grounds.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:36.310
The time limit is one hour.

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:37.320
If you find a card,

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.580
please bring it to the Rose Mansion
where we are headquartered.

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:42.920
You will be presented on the
spot with the additional prize,

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.820
a ticket for a date for half a day with a bouton.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:49.030
The treasure hunt ended up starting
before I had made up my mind.

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.590
What a fool I was.

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:54.700
Just because something I wanted
had been right in front of me,

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.470
I had acted without much thought...

00:12:57.070 --> 00:13:01.200
All too late, I had comprehended the
seriousness of what I had done.

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.140
And now... Start!

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:13.280
I have to put it back in its place.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:24.360
But even if I put it back, I doubt
anyone will find it in this place.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:28.460
Still, I can't very well hang on to it, either.

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.400
How did things end up this way?

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:38.570
All I had wanted was for Sachiko-san to notice me.

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.180
Does it hurt?

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:45.740
You got what you deserved for not
obeying the teacher's instructions.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.620
I'd gotten what I deserved.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:54.060
I had become trapped inside this
greenhouse, along with the red card.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:56.490
Oh!

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:04.100
Good day. I'm sorry. It seems I startled you.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:05.800
Oh, no...

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:08.310
Have you come here looking for the card, too?

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:09.340
Yes...

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.370
Fukuzawa Yumi-san.

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.240
The petite soeur that Sachiko-san chose.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:19.250
Oh, so Sachiko-san told Yumi-san
where she had hidden the card.

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:23.950
If so, I won't feel so bad about this.

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.930
From the perspective of the people
searching for Sachiko-san's card...

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.550
...without knowing anything,

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:31.290
Yumi-san would be about as guilty as I am.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.290
She's like a dog.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:39.270
But she's digging so eagerly
and so animatedly...

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.300
Could it be that Yumi-san?

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:43.830
Um...

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:47.010
Oh, I think the card is probably here, so...

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.440
She looks so earnest...

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:54.050
Yumi-san really figured out that
this was the place on her own.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.290
If you'd like, here...

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.450
Thank you.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.530
There would be no card,
no matter how deep she dug...

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.000
The more I postponed that conclusion,

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.060
the dirtier I felt.

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:09.360
I could no longer stand to watch.

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:11.870
But it wasn't there.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:12.400
What?

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:15.110
I'm sorry for not saying so before.

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.900
The truth is, I tried digging
in that spot just earlier.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:20.100
It can't be...

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.650
Why did you think the card would be there?

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:26.150
Why?

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:28.860
I wanted to know.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.790
If she hadn't been told in advance,

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:35.230
how was Yumi-san able to arrive at this place?

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.160
Because this rose is the Rosa chinensis...

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:40.930
What?

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.640
This is the Rosa chinensis?

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:48.870
A flower that is almost like a part of Sachiko-san.

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:52.610
That was why Sachiko-san hid the card here.

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:57.380
And Yumi-san alone figured it out.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.040
I've lost.

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:02.350
I've lost completely.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.560
It was right there next to me,

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:08.320
and yet, I never noticed the
significance of this flower.

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:11.760
It is now 4:40.

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.170
Those of you participating in the game,

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:15.570
please gather in the inner courtyard right away.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:16.900
The game is over.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:17.370
You know, Yumi-san...
The game is over.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:17.770
You know, Yumi-san...

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:18.340
You know, Yumi-san...
Please gather in the inner courtyard.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:19.640
It's over. I better clean up.
Please gather in the inner courtyard.

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:20.730
It's over. I better clean up.

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:23.480
I'll help you.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:24.370
Thank you.

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:29.380
I had been mystified for the longest time.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:31.490
Well, I'll say goodbye here.

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:32.420
Goodbye.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:38.060
"Why had Sachiko-san chosen her?"

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:48.490
"She is not worthy of Sachiko-san."

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.510
I had arbitrarily believed that,

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:54.940
but I realized something through today's events.

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:59.210
Yumi-san has something that I do not have.

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.850
And Sachiko-san saw that.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:06.210
Sachiko-san is a keen judge of character.

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:19.870
Every good one you draw...

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:23.360
...comes with a ticket to go on
a date for half a day with me.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:24.730
A date?

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:28.680
Oh, no, um, that is...

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:29.680
That sounds like fun.

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:30.170
What?

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:31.270
When?

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:32.600
Um...

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:35.200
Then, how about next Sunday?

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:37.950
All right. Where shall we go?

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.610
Do you have any preferences, Onee-sama?

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.980
I would like to go where you want to go.

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:44.550
Then, I will think about it.

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.420
I'm looking forward to it.

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.990
Shall we head home soon?

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:50.120
Yes.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:54.660
Did your college entrance exams go well?

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:57.400
No, I don't think I did well today.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.460
But for all that, you seem to be in a good mood.

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:00.640
Because...

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:05.600
Thanks to the treasure hunt event,
my wish came true.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.920
Oh, your wish to see the Rose Mansion...

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:12.250
...bustling with ordinary students
before you graduated?

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:31.240
Yes, today was the best day of my life.

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:32.570
Rosa Foetida!

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.040
Oh, Rei, what's wrong?

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:40.610
I've been looking for you.

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:41.240
What is it?

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:44.070
Would it be all right if I came
by your house tonight?

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.190
There is something I would like to give you.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.190
That would be fine.

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:47.920
Rei-chan!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:53.630
Why did you hide the card
in a weird place like that?!

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:56.730
Hiding it in the pages of a book
called "Edo Period Prices"?!

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:58.030
That's too hard to figure out!

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.490
Yoshino-chan's mad.

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.340
We can talk about that some other time!

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:04.100
I'll come over to your house tonight, too!

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:05.260
I don't care anymore!

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:07.340
Oh, Yoshino!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:09.300
Well, Onee-sama, I will see you later.

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.540
I wonder if it'll be truffles again this year.

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:15.950
So she goes to the trouble of
delivering them to your house.

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.880
They're hand-made and she
takes great pride in them.

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:18.950
I can't wait.

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:23.010
It's cold, isn't it?

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:28.290
Oh, yes. I received chocolate
bonbons from Shizuka.

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:29.690
Shall we warm ourselves up?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.930
You can be a little insensitive
sometimes, Onee-sama.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:33.970
Jealous?

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.330
That is not it.

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:40.440
If I were to partake in a gift
that was meant for you,

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:43.180
how would Shizuka-sama feel?

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:45.140
Shizuka's feelings...

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:48.070
Good point.

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:50.340
That was educational.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.650
Pardon me for sounding so patronizing.

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:57.150
I sure am one lucky girl to have
such a dependable little sister.

00:19:57.490 --> 00:19:58.760
With this, I can feel at ease...

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.250
Onee-sama, please do not say such things!

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:04.660
I...

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:09.360
When you are gone, I will surely...

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:13.200
It'll be okay.

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:16.210
When spring comes,
you'll be a second year student.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:18.410
There'll be new students...

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:21.580
...and before you know it,
my absence will have become normal.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:23.410
That's how it goes.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:28.620
I have a hard time believing that.

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:39.320
Onee-sama?

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.890
The marbled chocolate cake
was really delicious.

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:48.740
It's started snowing again.

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:23.740
Onee-sama, um, about this Sunday...

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:27.850
I'm sorry, but would you please go
back to the classroom without me?

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:31.950
In that case, shall I take your sewing box?

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:33.780
Would you mind?

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:36.980
Not at all. I shall leave it on your desk.

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:37.920
Thank you.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:41.090
I hope you enjoy your time with your big sister.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:46.190
So, what about Sunday?

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:50.300
She didn't notice it was me, after all.

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:51.900
What was that, Mifuyu-san?

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:53.560
Oh, no, it's nothing.

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:56.030
That hairstyle suits you.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:58.070
Do you think so? Thank you.

00:21:58.810 --> 00:22:02.050
Sachiko-san has found a wonderful little sister...

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:04.520
...and now, I am honestly happy for her.

00:22:06.390 --> 00:22:08.050
A small change had come over me,

00:22:08.460 --> 00:22:13.650
not just with my hairstyle,
but in my heart as well.

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:22.930
