00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:28.170
That mystery is about to be revealed now.

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:31.200
Um, Onee-sama, our show is not a mystery.

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:32.540
What? But Maria-sama is watching, right?

